      <transcript>BULANGGIR</transcript>
      <definition>[= bulunggir.], n. and adj. Distrubed lees or sediment in liquids; turbid; depraved, corrupt.</definition>
      <page>133</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠯᠠᠩᠺᠢᠷ ᠤᠰᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- usu</transcript>
          <definition>Muddy or turbid water.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
